# Golden hash changelog

Every entry below was appended automatically by
`scripts/verify_determinism.py --record --reason "..."` and records why a
committed replay hash moved. A moved hash is a 64-character hex diff on its
own -- unreviewable without the reason recorded here.

Do not hand-edit this file. Do not hand-edit `*.expected.txt` either; both
are written together by the same --record run.
